! mcp_bootstrap_p394.strap -- MCP printed page 394: the JC4 ERROR
! MESSAGES of the END OF JOB program ($EOJ), YJCEM .. YJ1FUL
! (C22-6728: "YJCEM through YJ1FUL are the JC4 error messages"), and
! the YC4CM/YC4CM1 constants between them.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.144, read at 400 dpi, doubtful
! glyphs at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22$EOJ
! CARD ID ZA000600  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 394"; the heading
! row's LOCATION field is BLANK (line 1 is a remark).  The Vision
! reading of this page is missing (v2_pdf144.geom is "none"), so
! tools/page_sheet.py 394 gives nothing; every value is read off the
! image alone.
!
! >>> STILL $EOJ. <<<  PUNID 22$EOJ, card series ZA, low core
! (0205xx-0207xx).  No SLC is printed; the SLC below is scaffolding for
! line 5's printed location.  p.393 ends with the half word B,YBRLOG at
! 020522.40, so the counter already stands at 020523.00 and line 4's
! CNOP emits nothing.  No TAIL.
!
! THE PAGE.  50 lines, every line number prints a "*"; a "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 5, 9, 12, 19, 23, 29, 33, 37, 40 and 45.
! Contiguous 020523.00 .. 020704.00 (line 50, a 16-character message;
! next 020706.00), then blank paper.
!   lines  1-3   remarks.
!   lines  4-42  CNOPs and (IQSX)/(AX)DD(BU) messages (no binary printed).
!   lines 43-47  DD(BU,32)/DD(BU) hex constants YC4CM, YC4CM1 (binary
!                printed, checked below).
!   lines 48-50  (IQS*)DD(BU) messages YC4CM2, YJ1FUL.
!
! >>> THE ENTRY-MODE BLANKS. <<<  Every message's length is fixed by the
! next printed LOCATION where one follows directly (7-11, 15-16, 19,
! 22-24, 27-32, 35-42, 48-49), and every interior/trailing blank was
! placed by measuring the ink column by column at 400 dpi (pitch 40.1
! px; the terminator's column gives the count).  Lines 5 (40 chars),
! 12 (32), 17 (20), 25 (16), 33 (31) and 50 (16) are measured only;
! 5, 17 and 33 then land exactly on the next printed location
! (020530.00, 020566.00, 020632.00).
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * Line 44 prints "(16)89CF0000" and line 47 "(16)8515CCC0"-like: the
!     open rounds are 0.  The printed binaries 21103600000 and
!     20505200000 are 0x890F0000 and 0x85150000; 0x89CF0000 would print
!     21163600000.  Line 43's "(16)0000001F" prints the same open round
!     for its zeros.
!   * YMOJM4 / YMOJM3 / YMOVJM / YMOJM2 (lines 10, 19, 22, 28) print
!     "YMCJMn"/"YMCVJM" (open); line 32 prints YMOJM1 with a CLOSED O.
!     Spelled O as p.390/p.393 use them, and the binaries there tie them.
!   * YCOMJM (line 42) prints "YCCMJM": p.267's stand-in spells YCOMJM.
!   * Line 35's label prints "Y EMJC" (a blank in the name, ignored):
!     YEMJC, as p.266/268's stand-ins.  Line 45's "Y C4CM1" likewise.
!   * YJ1FUL (line 49): digit 1, C22-6728 "YJCEM through YJ1FUL".
!   * Line 40's label prints one column right (" YICEM").
!   * Line 20 prints "HONORDX" (HONORED misspelt on the card): as printed.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  ZA000600 .. ZA000649, one per line.  p.393 ends at
! ZA000598: ZA000599 is printed on neither page.
!
! No externals: the page defines every symbol it uses.

        SLC, (8)020523.0
! line  1  - **********************************************************************
! line  2  -       JC4 ERROR MESSAGES
! line  3  - **********************************************************************
        CNOP                                                 ! line  4
YJCEM   (IQSX)DD(BU,64,8), PRESENT JOB REJECTED - NO JOB CARD.    X! line  5
        CNOP                                                 ! line  6
YDECJM  (AX)DD(BU),-JOB REJECTED ..X                         ! line  7
YDEJM1  (AX)DD(BU), TAPE UNIT-CHANNEL CONFLICT.    X         ! line  8
        (AX)DD(BU), REELCARD FOLLOWS A NON-TAPE IODX         ! line  9
YMOJM4  (AX)DD(BU), TYPE IS ILLEGAL ON AN IOD CARD X         ! line 10  printed YMCJM4
        (AX)DD(BU), TWO INFINITY DISK REQUESTS.    X         ! line 11
        (AX)DD(BU), FIRST IOD CARD IS ILLEGAL      X         ! line 12
        CNOP                                                 ! line 13
        CNOP                                                 ! line 14
YASRJM  (AX)DD(BU),-JOB REJECTED-...  X                      ! line 15
        (AX)DD(BU),I-O REQUESTS INCOMPATIBLEX                ! line 16
        (AX)DD(BU), WITH CONFIGURATION.X                     ! line 17
        CNOP                                                 ! line 18
YMOJM3  (AX)DD(BU),-JOB REJECTED- B LIMIT IS TOO HIX         ! line 19  printed YMCJM3
        (AX)DD(BU),GH FOR I-O REQUESTS TO BE HONORDX         ! line 20
        CNOP                                                 ! line 21
YMOVJM  (AX)DD(BU),-               X                         ! line 22  printed YMCVJM
        (AX)DD(BU),IOD CARD      HAX                         ! line 23
        (AX)DD(BU),S A TYPE     ERRX                         ! line 24
        (AX)DD(BU),OR.             X                         ! line 25
        CNOP                                                 ! line 26
YISUKM  (AX)DD(BU),DUE TO REPEATED UKS IN SCANNING.X         ! line 27
YMOJM2  (AX)DD(BU),-JOB REJECTED-..X                         ! line 28  printed YMCJM2
        (AX)DD(BU),TOO MUCH DISK REX                         ! line 29
        (AX)DD(BU),QUESTED.        X                         ! line 30
        (AX)DD(BU),                X                         ! line 31
YMOJM1  (AX)DD(BU),-JOB REJECTED-... IOD CARD HAS ANX        ! line 32
        (AX)DD(BU), INVALID REFERENCE NUMBER.     X          ! line 33
        CNOP                                                 ! line 34
YEMJC   (AX)DD(BU),-   JOB CARD ERROR              X         ! line 35  printed Y EMJC
YTCEM   (AX)DD(BU),-    TYPE CARD ERROR            X         ! line 36
        (AX)DD(BU),-   JOB REJECTED.               X         ! line 37
YLCEM   (AX)DD(BU),-   LIM CARD ERROR              X         ! line 38
        (AX)DD(BU),-   JOB REJECTED.               X         ! line 39
YICEM   (AX)DD(BU),-         IOD CARD        ERROR X         ! line 40  label printed one column right
        (AX)DD(BU),-   JOB REJECTED.               X         ! line 41
YCOMJM  (AX)DD(BU),BY OPERATOR IN PHASE ONE.       X         ! line 42  printed YCCMJM
YC4CM   DD(BU,32),(16)0000001F                               ! line 43  -JOB IN RED
        DD(BU,32),(16)890F0000                               ! line 44  printed 89CF0000
YC4CM1  DD(BU),(16)0000000                                   ! line 45  printed Y C4CM1  - , TIME IN RED
        DD(BU,32),(16)0800931D                               ! line 46
        DD(BU,32),(16)85150000                               ! line 47  printed "8515CCC0"-like
YC4CM2  (IQS*)DD(BU),        *                               ! line 48
YJ1FUL  (IQS*)DD(BU),THE SCAN TABLES ARE FULL. THE PHASE I TAPE MAY B*! line 49
        (IQS*)DD(BU),E STOPPED.      *                       ! line 50

!SYM YJCEM  020523.00
!SYM YDECJM 020530.00
!SYM YDEJM1 020532.00
!SYM YMOJM4 020542.00
!SYM YASRJM 020556.00
!SYM YMOJM3 020566.00
!SYM YMOVJM 020576.00
!SYM YISUKM 020606.00
!SYM YMOJM2 020612.00
!SYM YMOJM1 020622.00
!SYM YEMJC  020632.00
!SYM YTCEM  020636.00
!SYM YLCEM  020646.00
!SYM YICEM  020656.00
!SYM YCOMJM 020666.00
!SYM YC4CM  020672.00
!SYM YC4CM1 020673.00
!SYM YC4CM2 020675.00
!SYM YJ1FUL 020676.00
!CHECK 020672.00 | 00000000037 | line 43 YC4CM DD(BU,32),(16)0000001F | 32
!CHECK 020672.40 | 21103600000 | line 44 DD(BU,32),(16)890F0000 (printed "89CF0000"; the open round is 0, as the binary says) | 32
!CHECK 020673.00 | 0000000000000000000000 | line 45 YC4CM1 DD(BU),(16)0000000 (a "*" after the location) | 64
!CHECK 020674.00 | 01000111435 | line 46 DD(BU,32),(16)0800931D | 32
!CHECK 020674.40 | 20505200000 | line 47 DD(BU,32),(16)85150000 (printed "8515CCC0"-like; the open rounds are 0, as the binary says) | 32
